00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.650
Sakura's heart...

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.650
...is Miss Mana's...?

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.350
What?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.690
Miss Sakura Kawasaki!
May we have a moment?!

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:52.770
Is it true that you had a heart transplant?!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:53.760
Um...

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.100
Excuse me.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.560
Will you please send your questions
in writing to our agency?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:03.940
There are rumors on the internet that Miss
Sakura's heart donor is Miss Mana Nagase!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:04.980
Do you know about this?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.810
According to our investigation...

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.100
Yes.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.850
The number of reporters
has been increasing.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:15.310
Got it.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.440
Leave the rest to me.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.150
Makino...

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.900
Take care of Sakura and the others.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.900
Yes.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.810
What? Is Sakura okay?

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:28.980
Yes.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:33.060
She said she'll be fine after
she rests a little...

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:36.230
I think it was a real shock for her.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.690
Singing is impossible for her right now.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.270
Sakura, you should go back
to the dorms for today.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.190
That's okay, I'll be fine after I rest a little.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:50.940
There's no point in anyone practicing
this song if I'm not here.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:54.150
Even then, if you don't feel well, speak up.

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.770
Yes...

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.690
Mr. Makino...

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:03.900
Did you know that Miss Mana's heart
was transplanted to another person?

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.480
Kotono told me yesterday.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.810
According to Kotono's mother,

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.520
Miss Mana was a registered donor,

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:15.060
and there were talks about it
after the accident...

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:19.230
Do you think her heart could be...?

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.810
I'm sure you're aware, Sakura...

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:25.690
In Japan, any info on the donor is confidential.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.480
Even if you're family,
there's no way to find out.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:32.810
If there's no way to find out,
it's useless to worry about it.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.060
Yes.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.520
You're right.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:36.810
Sakura...

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.230
Are you okay?

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:40.980
Yes! I've calmed down now.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.650
The second round is right around the corner!

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.850
Mana!

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:48.940
What?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.100
Why weren't you around today?

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.690
Is there a rule that I need
to be around all the time?

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:58.270
Do you know about the recent internet
rumors regarding Sakura's heart?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.560
I do!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.480
The rumor that her heart is mine, right?

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.270
There's no way that could be true!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.150
Even you can't tell?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.150
Your guess is as good as mine.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.270
You should be asking
a doctor about this stuff.

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:18.980
Mr. Makino, it's Sakura.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.440
I'm sorry.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.270
What's the matter?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.480
Um...

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.310
I couldn't say this earlier...

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:35.020
But my heart...

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.190
...is Miss Mana's!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.520
What?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.350
I didn't believe it at first...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.060
But the more I think about it...

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.100
No, I just know it!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:54.270
This heart belonged to Miss Mana.

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.850
How I suddenly was able to sing one day...

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.600
How I was guided to an opportunity
to become an idol...

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.560
It's all because this heart
belonged to Miss Mana.

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:07.230
The reason why people say I sound like her...

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.440
How it felt right when I sang that song...

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.900
It would all make sense!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:14.270
Wait a minute.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:15.840
That's ridiculous.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:16.850
To be honest,

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:20.440
I realized it when we went to the hospital
for your check up the other day.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:22.650
That your transplanted heart...

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.100
...belonged to Mana.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.480
What?

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.560
I'm sorry for not telling you.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.020
You're kidding, right?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.730
I'm not kidding.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.810
The day you died...

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.480
The day Sakura had her surgery...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.100
It all makes sense.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.940
Makino!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.100
I can't believe it, either.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.270
How could such a coincidence happen...?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.850
Even if it could, all of this is inexplicable...

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:49.940
I've had enough!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:50.850
I'm gonna get Mei.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:51.810
Mana!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.520
What?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:59.150
It's likely that you exist here because of
something that has to do with your heart.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.310
Mana?

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.810
Yeah, Mana's here.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.310
Right there.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.190
As a ghost.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.150
Miss Mana...

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.520
<i>Idoly Pride</i> .

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:23.150
Mei, you're able to see Miss Mana?

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.480
Sure can!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.900
I kept it a secret from everyone, though!

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.310
But why?

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:30.150
I told her to.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:33.560
I especially didn't want Kotono to know.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.940
That's what Mana wants.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:40.350
Kotono... would be happy to know.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.060
She can't be happy about it.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.600
She says, "She can't be happy about it."

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.100
Why is that?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.770
She's asking, "Why?"

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.850
I can hear her.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.730
Oh, yeah.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:58.230
I think Kotono made it to this point
because I wasn't around.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:02.730
If she knew I was around,
her tense focus would snap.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:04.400
I see.

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:07.270
Could you relay that to her?!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:10.230
I still can't believe this...

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:13.600
Hey, Mei, will you tell this to Sakura?

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:16.400
That she doesn't need to sing my song?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.090
What?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.060
Mana.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.270
Tell her.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.020
O-Okay.

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:25.350
Mana's saying that you
don't have to sing her song.

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:27.770
What? But why?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:30.520
It's not your own song, Sakura.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:34.600
The listener is sensitive to those things.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.730
To whom is it being sung?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:40.020
What is the singer thinking on stage...?

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.190
Are they desperate?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:45.150
Sad? Happy? They can sense it all.

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:49.100
Slow down! I can't remember
every word you say!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.900
Listen, Sakura.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.650
You can't reach the top as an idol

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:57.020
unless you sing from the bottom of
your heart, the song only you can sing.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:01.230
What you need to face isn't Kotono or me.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.020
It's the people who support you.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:09.190
You'll never move anyone's heart
if you don't put in your all.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:13.150
Mana, Sakura can't hear your voice...

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.190
Put in my all...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.480
Sakura...

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.600
Did you hear her?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:21.400
No...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.940
But my heart...

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:27.100
It felt like it said that...

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.770
So it really is my heart.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:35.060
My life was saved by this heart.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:41.770
As long as I follow the beating of this heart,
things will go well and everything becomes fun.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:43.850
Is that all being an idol is to you?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.270
Mana...

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:50.350
Is that the only reason you came
to become an idol, Sakura?

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.810
What is it...?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:58.600
Was your becoming an idol solely based on your
heart's guidance without any of your own will?

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.020
At first it was.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.270
But...

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.020
It's different now!

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.520
As I became friends with Kotono
and the others,

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:09.350
and started to chase after a big goal,

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:13.060
I realized that this was what
I truly wanted to do!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:17.940
That's why I am really grateful for this heart.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:24.690
It's allowed me to find what I really wanted to
do, something I wasn't able to realize myself.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:28.400
It means this heart is
partly Sakura's, too, now.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:31.560
Sakura is herself plus your heart.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:38.150
Along with how she sounds like you and how she
takes action based on the beating of that heart.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.060
I was always worried.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.020
Is it okay for me to sing Miss Mana's song?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:50.480
But now that I know this heart belonged
to Mana, I've reached clarity.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:54.020
I'm the one who has to sing that song!

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:57.350
I don't know if I could sing it
as well as you, Miss Mana...

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.690
But I want to tell Kotono, too.

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:05.230
Since this is Miss Mana's heart,
I will take responsibility for singing it!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:07.150
When she puts it like that,

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.770
I have to agree with her!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.190
No.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.020
That's still not enough.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.400
Mana?

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.310
I'll explain it all right now.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:24.310
So Makino, relay it to Sakura verbatim!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.190
What? Verbatim?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.940
Wait a minute.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:34.560
It's true that I regret how I couldn't
sing that song in the finals.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:39.980
Because I really wanted everyone
to hear that wonderful song.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:43.770
But I never thought of having
someone else sing it.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:48.400
If I had wanted to dispel this feeling, I would
have to be the one who sings it on stage.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.730
It may not seem like it,
but I still have pride as an idol.

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.480
No matter how good the singer is,

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:56.690
or even if they sound exactly like me,

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:59.770
I don't think they would be able
to sing it better than me!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:03.480
My song only belongs to me!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:11.600
Above all else, what I want is for you
and Kotono to stand at the top as idols.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.600
You can get there.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:15.980
I've seen many idols so far,

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:19.520
and I felt potential from you two.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.150
But you can't go on like this.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:29.270
You won't make it unless you're able to sing
the song only you, and no one else, can sing.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.690
Don't worry about me at all--

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:35.100
just find your song with your members.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:40.730
And I want you to aim for the top
as you work hard as rivals.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:46.230
I was able to work as hard as I did
because of Rio of LizNoir, too.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.940
I didn't want to admit that
at the time, though.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.980
Oh, you don't have to type that out.

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:58.480
I want to see Moon Tempest and
Sunny Peace stand at the top.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:00.060
We can...?

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.020
She says you can stand at the top as idols!

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.810
That's the only thing...

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:12.810
...that will fulfill what I left undone.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:20.480
I'm going to talk to Kotono about my heart.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.850
About Mana's ghost, too?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:26.150
If Miss Mana doesn't want that, I won't.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:27.400
Thank you.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.770
She says, "Thank you."

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:38.730
Mana, what is the thing you left undone--?

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.190
Mana?!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:45.580
"Analyze Math II+B"
"Physics"
"Voice Training"
"Dance Training”

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:45.600
So it's really my sister's heart?

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:46.810
Yeah.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:51.900
I don't know if that's the reason
I'm able to sing with her voice, though.

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.730
Big Sister's...

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:57.150
So, I don't know how to say this...

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.310
Sakura.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.400
Can I ask you a weird favor...?

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:04.310
What is it?

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.520
The heartbeat...

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.350
Will you let me listen to it?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.810
So...

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.850
Yeah.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:34.350
Big Sister...

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:37.810
Sorry.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:40.150
No worries.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:44.940
So, this is the thing, Kotono...

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:46.690
I've decided!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.980
Mana, are you okay?

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.730
I'm okay.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:02.150
I just can't keep my energy up.

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:03.350
Energy?

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.400
Yeah.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.900
My body feels heavy...

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.900
♬ As the precious things ♬

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.810
Sakura...?

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:17.350
♬ Stay the same ♬

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.940
Huh?

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.350
I'm suddenly feeling better...

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:19.650
♬ From the beginning ♬

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:23.560
♬ I want ♬

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:31.730
♬ to bring my voice to you ♬

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.520
♬ Right now ♬

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.100
♬ Song for you ♬

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.190
♬ Your gaze ♬

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.900
♬ It was ♬

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:45.270
I've decided that the next performance will be
the last I sing with Miss Mana's voice.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:45.270
♬ Your gaze ♬

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:53.400
♬ That lit up the cold world for me ♬

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:51.190
Big Sister...

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:01.730
Hello! I'm Sakura Kawasaki of Sunny Peace.

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:06.060
I'd like to take this opportunity
to speak to you all.

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:14.440
Three years ago,
I received a heart transplant.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.190
From my life-threatening disease,

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.940
what saved me was a heart
from an unknown donor

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:24.310
that was transplanted into me.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:26.770
Not only did it save my life,

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:32.020
I believe that I am able to stand here
as an idol because of this heart, too.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.190
Sakura.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:37.980
I am aware of the different rumors
surrounding my heart.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.730
In regard to organ transplant surgery,

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:45.520
for privacy and fairness, any information
is kept confidential in this country,

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.900
even to the donor and receiver.

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:50.400
So...

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:55.020
I'm unable to say whether
the rumors are true or not.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:21:00.150
I've wondered who the donor
might be over and over again!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.980
There were many people
I've imagined it could be,

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:06.350
but there was only one feeling
I've wanted to express!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:09.770
Today... For today's performance...

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:14.440
Please let me put in all the feelings
I have right now and sing.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:18.480
The winner is...

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:22.810
...Sunny Peace!

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Embrace the Courage You've Been Given

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:46.850
Thank you!
